-- ============================================================================
-- AZURE-001: Synthetic seed data - CREDIT_EXPOSURE
--
-- 20 exposure records total:
--   - One exposure each for 15 clean customers (CUST-000001 .. CUST-000015) = 15 rows
--   - 5 deliberate defect rows, all technically insertable                  =  5 rows
--
-- Defects included:
--   1. CUSTOMER_ID with no matching row in CUSTOMER_MASTER (Oracle) -
--      expected cross-source referential-integrity gap.
--   2. UTILIZATION_PCT above 100% (not physically constrained).
--   3. Negative LIMIT_AMOUNT (not physically constrained).
--   4. Zero EXPOSURE_AMOUNT on an active facility (edge case).
--   5. AS_OF_DATE in the future.
-- ============================================================================

